OL,3,GNEWSAShops evacuated and roads closed
OL,4,Aamid gas leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FShops have been evacuated and multiple
OL,7,Froads have been closed after a
OL,8,Fsuspected gas leak.
OL,10,FPolice and fire teams were called to
OL,11,FSilver Street in Bradford on Avon,
OL,12,FWiltshire, at 11:02 BST. A gas engineer
OL,13,Fis also at the scene.
OL,15,FPeople have been urged to avoid the
OL,16,Farea as Town Bridge, Market Street,
OL,17,FSilver Street and St Margaret's Street
OL,18,Fare "likely to remain closed for the
OL,19,Fforeseeable future", according to
OL,20,Fpolice.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
