OL,3,GNEWSAShops evacuated and roads closed
OL,4,Aamid gas leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Dorset and Wiltshire Fire and Rescue
OL,7,FService spokesperson said: "A cordon
OL,8,Fhas been put in place, and the road has
OL,9,Fbeen closed near Market Street
OL,10,Froundabout which is affecting several
OL,11,Froutes through the town."
